<p><font size="6">O</font><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">nce again 
  Emp Ssra falls to CoV and Immortal!<br>
  Congrats to all who have finished both Emperors keys and VT access!!!</font><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif"><br>
  <br>
  <img src="http://circleofvalor.net/screenshots/EmpSsra.jpg" width="762" height="659"></font></p>
<p><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif"><br>
  </font><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Also Downed this week was 
  Lord Mith Marr. Grats to Immy on making Sol Ro Tower<br>
  and furthering our advancement into PoP as an Alliance. WTG all!!!<br>
  Old picture but, I wasn't there this time :o</font></p>
<p><br>
  <img src="http://circleofvalor.net/screenshots/ssotd_sep2303.jpg" width="761" height="670"> 
